  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nAn alien has kidnapped Matt Damon, not knowing what lengths humanity goes through to retrieve him whenever he goes missing. The thing is though, humans do not really realize who Matt Damon really is... or I should say \"what\" he really is. \n\nMatt Damon is really a reptilian, and people have no idea. The alien has taken Matt Damon to his home planet, which is very similar to Earth, because it is Earth. Deep underground on this very flat Earth. Reptilians are the ones fooling people into thinking the Earth is round. They get to their underground world through a gate at Area 51.\n\nThe alien has no idea what he has gotten himself into, and the humans have no idea what they are getting themselves into. People around the world are searching high and low for their hero.\nThe alien and Matt Damon started to worry that people would find them, and uncover their conspiracies and the game would be up for them. \n\nThe alien and Matt Damon were able to escape, and they are now on the run from the humans. Now they are hiding under the pyramids they they built ages ago while the sphinx watches over them like a surveillance system to make sure they are not found out. They started to make a plan. A great plan the alien and Matt had also.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 21,
  "reference_text": "  They were going to drop Matt off near a forest, and Matt would say he was abducted and tested on. The humans would believe him, and the alien would be safe. Then they would make a movie about it, and call it \"Fire in the Ground\". It would make millions and stir people up.",
